---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import '../styles/prose.css';

const lastUpdated = 'August 12, 2026';
---

<BaseLayout title="Terms of Service — Regenitiva" description="The terms that govern your use of the Regenitiva website.">

  <section class="legal">
    <div class="legal-inner">
      <header class="legal-header">
        <div class="legal-eyebrow">Legal</div>
        <h1 class="legal-title">Terms of Service</h1>
        <p class="legal-updated">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>
      </header>

      <article class="prose">
        <p>These Terms of Service ("Terms") govern your use of the website operated by Regenitiva LLC ("Regenitiva," "we," "us," or "our"). By accessing or using this website, you agree to these Terms. If you do not agree, please do not use the site.</p>

        <h2>About This Website</h2>
        <p>This website provides general information about Regenitiva's practice development, management, and consulting services for regenerative medicine. The content is for informational purposes only and may be updated or changed at any time without notice.</p>

        <h2>Not Medical Advice</h2>
        <p>Nothing on this website is medical advice, and it is not a substitute for the professional judgment of a licensed physician. Regenitiva does not practice medicine and does not make clinical decisions. Descriptions of PRP and other regenerative treatments are general and educational; individual results vary, and not every patient is a candidate. Physicians retain full clinical authority for their patients.</p>

        <h2>No Professional Relationship</h2>
        <p>Using this website or contacting us through it does not create a client, consulting, or professional relationship. Any engagement with Regenitiva is governed by a separate written agreement. Statements about timelines, outcomes, or services on this site are general and do not constitute a promise or guarantee.</p>

        <h2>Intellectual Property</h2>
        <p>The content on this website — including text, graphics, logos, and design — is owned by or licensed to Regenitiva and is protected by intellectual property laws. You may not copy, reproduce, or distribute it without our prior written permission.</p>

        <h2>Acceptable Use</h2>
        <p>You agree not to use this website to violate any law, infringe anyone's rights, transmit harmful code, attempt to gain unauthorized access to our systems, or interfere with the site's operation.</p>

        <h2>Third-Party Links</h2>
        <p>This website may contain links to third-party sites. We are not responsible for the content, policies, or practices of those sites, and links do not imply our endorsement.</p>

        <h2>Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>
        <p>This website is provided "as is" and "as available," without warranties of any kind, whether express or implied, including warranties of merchantability, fitness for a particular purpose, and non-infringement. We do not warrant that the site will be uninterrupted, error-free, or free of harmful components.</p>

        <h2>Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p>To the fullest extent permitted by law, Regenitiva will not be liable for any indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages arising out of your use of, or inability to use, this website.</p>

        <h2>Governing Law</h2>
        <p>These Terms are governed by the laws of the State of Tennessee, without regard to its conflict-of-law principles. Any dispute relating to these Terms or the website will be subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the state and federal courts located in Tennessee.</p>

        <h2>Changes to These Terms</h2>
        <p>We may update these Terms from time to time. When we do, we will revise the "Last updated" date above. Your continued use of the website after any change indicates your acceptance of the updated Terms.</p>

        <h2>Contact Us</h2>
        <p>If you have questions about these Terms, contact us at <a href="mailto:vincesurra@regenitiva.com">vincesurra@regenitiva.com</a> or 805-896-7983, 1860 Wilma Rudolph Blvd 128V, Clarksville, TN 37040.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal-inner {
    max-width: 820px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 40px var(--rg-space-5) var(--rg-space-8);
  }

  .legal-header {
    padding-bottom: var(--rg-space-6);
    margin-bottom: var(--rg-space-6);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rg-border);
  }

  .legal-eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--rg-font-display);
    font-size: var(--rg-size-eyebrow);
    font-weight: var(--rg-weight-bold);
    letter-spacing: var(--rg-ls-eyebrow);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--rg-text-accent);
    margin-bottom: var(--rg-space-4);
  }

  .legal-title {
    margin-bottom: var(--rg-space-3);
  }

  .legal-updated {
    font-size: var(--rg-size-small);
    color: var(--rg-text-muted);
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .legal-inner { padding: 72px var(--rg-space-7) 96px; }
  }
</style>
